### Crear pedido -> publica PedidoCreado
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P001", "quantity": 2, "customerEmail": "ana@example.com" }

### Otro pedido
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P003", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "juan@example.com" }

### Sin stock (409, no se publica evento)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P002", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "ana@example.com" }

### Estado de Orders (conexión a RabbitMQ y eventos pendientes)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Listar pedidos
GET http://localhost:3000/orders
